{
  "id": "JOB.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 9",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Job",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Job replied:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Indeed, I know that this is true.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "But how can mere mortals prove their innocence before God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though they wished to dispute with him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they could not answer him one time out of a thousand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His wisdom is profound, his power is vast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who has resisted him and come out unscathed?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He moves mountains without their knowing it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and overturns them in his anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shakes the earth from its place",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and makes its pillars tremble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He speaks to the sun and it does not shine;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he seals off the light of the stars.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He alone stretches out the heavens",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and treads on the waves of the sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is the Maker of the Bear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and Orion,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the Pleiades and the constellations of the south.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He performs wonders that cannot be fathomed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "miracles that cannot be counted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he passes me, I cannot see him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "when he goes by, I cannot perceive him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he snatches away, who can stop him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who can say to him, 'What are you doing?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God does not restrain his anger;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "even the cohorts of Rahab cowered at his feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"How then can I dispute with him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "How can I find words to argue with him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though I were innocent, I could not answer him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I could only plead with my Judge for mercy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if I summoned him and he responded,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I do not believe he would give me a hearing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He would crush me with a storm",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and multiply my wounds for no reason.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He would not let me catch my breath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but would overwhelm me with misery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it is a matter of strength, he is mighty!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "And if it is a matter of justice, who can challenge him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if I were innocent, my mouth would condemn me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "if I were blameless, it would pronounce me guilty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Although I am blameless,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I have no concern for myself;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I despise my own life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is all the same; that is why I say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'He destroys both the blameless and the wicked.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When a scourge brings sudden death,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he mocks the despair of the innocent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When a land falls into the hands of the wicked,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he blindfolds its judges.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "If it is not he, then who is it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"My days are swifter than a runner;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they fly away without a glimpse of joy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They skim past like boats of papyrus,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like eagles swooping down on their prey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I say, 'I will forget my complaint,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will change my expression, and smile,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I still dread all my sufferings,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for I know you will not hold me innocent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Since I am already found guilty,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "why should I struggle in vain?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if I washed myself with soap",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and my hands with cleansing powder,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "you would plunge me into a slime pit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so that even my clothes would detest me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"He is not a mere mortal like me that I might answer him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that we might confront each other in court.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If only there were someone to mediate between us,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "someone to bring us together,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "someone to remove God's rod from me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "so that his terror would frighten me no more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I would speak up without fear of him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JOB 9:35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but as it now stands with me, I cannot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
